<title>USA: NFL AMERICAN FOOTBALL-PLAYOFF MATCHUPS AFTER WEEKEND'S WILD-CARD GAMES.</title>
<headline>NFL AMERICAN FOOTBALL-PLAYOFF MATCHUPS AFTER WEEKEND'S WILD-CARD GAMES.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Matchups in National Football</p>
<p>League playoffs after the weekend's wild-card games (home team</p>
<p>in CAPS):</p>
