<p>NFC: San Francisco (13-4) at GREEN BAY (13-3)</p>
<p>AFC: Jacksonville (10-7) at DENVER (13-3)</p>
<p>Sunday, January 5</p>
<p>AFC: Pittsburgh (11-6) at NEW ENGLAND (11-5)</p>
<p>NFC: Dallas (11-6) at CAROLINA (12-4)</p>
